{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20557","headline":"赠别王侍御赴任陕州司马 · 张籍","name":"赠别王侍御赴任陕州司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京城在处闲人少，唯共君行并马蹄。\n更和诗篇名最出，时倾杯酒户常齐。\n同趋阙下听钟漏，独向军前闻鼓鼙。\n今日春明门外别，更无因得到街西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}